Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,70)\fad(180,220)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs32\c&H001CCEFF}Justin D'Souza (Asymptote Labs)
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,132)\fad(180,220)}“Open source got us into
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,196)\fad(180,220)}enterprises that had no
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,260)\fad(180,220)}other reason to trust
Dialogue: 3,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.20,Card,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,324)\fad(180,220)}us”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,When it was just me and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.78,0:00:01.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,my co-founder and we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:02.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,were pitching some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.84,0:00:03.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,really large
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.72,0:00:04.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,enterprises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,a question we'd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,constantly get asked is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:07.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:08.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:09.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,We've never heard of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the answer we would
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:11.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,have would be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:12.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,well, we have an open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:13.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,source project
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:14.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and so like your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,security team can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:16.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,inspect the code base
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:17.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can run it in your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:19.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,own infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,And that helped us build
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:22.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,trust and get deployed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,at large enterprises
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:24.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,when they would have had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:25.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,no other reason really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:27.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:28.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,And so I think that's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:30.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,still an accruing reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:32.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,for enterprises to trust
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:34.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,small companies.
